/* Manual fix: comparison table checkmarks (fa-check / fa-check-circle) rely
   on Font Awesome's icon font, which isn't loaded anywhere on this site —
   only inline SVG icons are used elsewhere. Without the font, these <i>
   tags render as empty invisible glyphs. Replace with a reliable CSS-drawn
   checkmark instead of pulling in an entire external font library. */
.hosting-feature-table i.fa-check-circle::before,
.hosting-feature-table i.fa-check::before {
    content: "\2713";
    display: inline-block;
    color: #0CC0DF;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 16px;
}
.hosting-feature-table td.bg-main i.fa-check::before {
    color: #fff;
    margin-right: 8px;
}

/* Manual fix: the plan comparison table (Essentials/Growth/Premium/Elite)
   originally hid 3 of 4 plan name+price header cells by default, only
   revealing one at a time via the tab buttons above the table. Per
   request, show all 4 plan columns at once instead, and hide the
   now-redundant tab buttons entirely. */
